<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/industrial-iot">Industrial &amp; IoT</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">IoT Device Assembly</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Industrial &amp; IoT products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/industrial-iot/pcba-box-build"><span class="abbr">PB</span><span class="label">PCBA &amp; Box Build</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/industrial-iot/iot-device-assembly"><span class="abbr">ID</span><span class="label">IoT Device Assembly</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/industrial-iot/rfid-asset-tracking"><span class="abbr">RT</span><span class="label">RFID Asset Tracking</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/industrial-iot/power-modules"><span class="abbr">PM</span><span class="label">Power Modules</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the product does and where it runs and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Industrial &amp; IoT &middot; IoT Device Assembly</div><h1 class="mk-h1">IoT device assembly — from board to connected product</h1><p class="mk-lede">A connected device is an integration problem before it is a board problem. The radio, the antenna, the sensors, the battery and the enclosure only meet each other once they are inside the same housing, and the faults that appear at that point are the expensive ones to find late.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-iot-device-assembly" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ IoT Device Assembly &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-iot-device-assembly" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Hana assembles the whole unit rather than handing a board across: PCBA with embedded wireless modules, antenna and sensor integration, battery and harness, enclosure and final mechanical assembly — then functional test on the assembled product, not on the bare board. Wireless test is done in-house. Box build has run on our lines for years, alongside our industrial and medical work.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Complete connected devices</span></div><div class="desc">board, radio, sensors, battery and enclosure built and tested as one finished, shippable unit.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Board, radio and antenna integration</span></div><div class="desc">PCBA carrying embedded wireless modules, with antenna and sensor integration handled on the same line as the board build.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Enclosure, cable and harness assembly</span></div><div class="desc">cable and harness build, enclosure fitting and final mechanical assembly around the board.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Wireless functional test</span></div><div class="desc">802.11 embedded wireless module test, GSM/cellular and GPS test, and Bluetooth and acoustic test, with the test set selected per program.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">Process depth sits on the capability page: Box Build owns the full product-assembly envelope, from the surface-mount board underneath through to configuration and packout.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build/box-build">Explore Box Build <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:820px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Test the product, not the board</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Wireless is where a device build most often comes apart. A radio that passes at board level can behave differently once its antenna sits alongside a battery, a metal bracket and a molded housing — and by then the assembly is closed. Hana's answer is to test the assembled unit. In-house wireless functional test covers 802.11 embedded modules, GSM and cellular, GPS, and Bluetooth and acoustic rigs, selected to what the program actually needs to prove. Builds can be run at pilot and pre-production quantities before volume, so the assembly sequence and its test coverage are settled on real units rather than on paper.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">PCBA and box build</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">PCBA and box build</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/koh-kong"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Cambodia</span></span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div><div class="note">final assembly, cable and harness</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana assemble my whole IoT device, not just the PCB?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Box build covers the radio, sensors, battery, cable and harness, and the enclosure and mechanical parts around the board, assembled and functionally tested as one finished unit before it ships.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How can Hana test a wireless product before it ships?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">On the assembled device rather than the board. Wireless functional test available in-house covers 802.11 embedded modules, GSM and cellular, GPS, and Bluetooth and acoustic test. The set applied is selected per program and confirmed per site.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana support a pilot build before volume production?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Pilot and pre-production builds can be run ahead of volume so the assembly sequence, the fixtures and the test coverage are proven on real units first.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/industrial-iot" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Industrial &amp; IoT market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your connected-device program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>
